# SHADDAI MCP — PUBLIC EDITION IS KEY-FREE.
#
# No API keys are needed. This server ships the 7 agents + their RAG knowledge
# bases and returns retrieved passages; the connected host model (Claude)
# synthesizes the answers. There are no external LLM calls and no .env required.
#
# Optional env vars (all have safe defaults — you can ignore this file):
#   SHADDAI_RAG_KB_PREFIX   KB namespace prefix (default: kb_)
#   SHADDAI_MCP_PORT        unused (stdio-only server)
